.code-intelligence/

# Live experiment event logs — a running meeting01 process holds one of these
# open (single long-lived ofstream) for the whole run. If git ever mutates the
# working-tree copy (checkout / stash / clean / a background auto-commit that
# reverts it) the process's fd is orphaned onto the old inode and the on-disk
# log silently freezes mid-run — the run still finishes but has no session_end,
# so the monitor reports a false "[FAILED]". Never track these.
results/meeting01/*_events.jsonl
results/thesis/**/*_events.jsonl
